{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>What shall we say to my lord.</b> Concerning the first money. <b>What shall we speak</b> now concerning the goblet. <b>And how shall we justify ourselves</b> — and what claim shall we claim and justify ourselves. <b>Elohim has found the iniquity of your servants.</b> They justified the judgment upon themselves and said: we know that we are innocent of all this, but we are guilty from another place, and from before HaShem, may He be exalted, the prosecutor went forth to mention the iniquity of your servants, <b>Behold, we are servants to my lord, both we and he in whose hand the goblet was found.</b>"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:11.749848257Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}